# Define topics of interest for the Project Aura worker to monitor and score
topics:
  - label: "Technology & Software Engineering"
    description: >
      Discussions about software engineering, system architecture, programming languages
      (Python, C#, Rust, Go), APIs, microservices, databases, and DevOps.
  - label: "Important Announcements & Events"
    description: >
      Key organizational updates, scheduled meetings, venue bookings, production schedules,
      and critical deadlines.
  - label: "Direct Mentions"
    description: >
      Messages that explicitly mention or direct questions to you by name or username.
